  "_clips": "loop: sampled cyclically (last key = first). measure_speed: record the planted-foot ground speed, so the game can set the blend-space sample's play rate and the feet do not slide. also_as: further template assets that get the same motion; the 8-way walk/jog samples all take the forward cycle, which is right for a character that turns to face its movement (bOrientRotationToMovement) and wrong for a strafing one.",
  "clips": {
    "MM_Idle": {"library": "ual1", "action": "Idle_Loop", "loop": true},
    "MF_Unarmed_Walk_Fwd": {"library": "ual1", "action": "Walk_Loop", "loop": true, "measure_speed": true,
      "also_as": ["MF_Unarmed_Walk_Fwd_Left", "MF_Unarmed_Walk_Fwd_Right", "MF_Unarmed_Walk_Left", "MF_Unarmed_Walk_Right",
